WEBVTT

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:48.460
They probably sent them in because
you're all so incompetent!

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:50.880
- ﻿You okay?
- I'm fine.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:53.880
Bellri, you managed to save that woman.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.590
You may have saved this girl too.

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:58.390
Good work out there tonight.

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:02.640
I know it's an imposition, but come to
the Research Division again tomorrow.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:03.770
Y-Yes, sir.

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:04.640
Pardon me.

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:07.310
The Research Division will take
that thing too, not just the woman!
Let me down, I said!

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:08.360
How many times do I have to explain this?

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:10.860
Your treatment of me is in
violation of international law!

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:13.530
I thought you said you weren't
with the Amerian Army?

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.860
Then it's not a violation.

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:17.320
Ah, Captain!

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:20.330
We've discovered that backpack
was built by the Amerian Army.

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:22.790
By the manufacturer's plates on it, yes?

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:27.620
However, even after a week, the
Capital Army couldn't get it to move.

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:29.380
The Research Division will
be handling it from here on.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:33.300
You were the one pulling the strings
behind the Capital Army to begin with.

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:34.840
- Captain Becker.
- ﻿What is it?

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:38.590
This is the student I was telling
you about, Cadet Luin Lee.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:40.350
I hear you're a Kuntala.

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:42.220
Is it really that repulsive?

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.810
People hate you because you talk like that.

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:49.150
You both dodged and blocked it, huh?

00:02:49.150 --> 00:02:50.980
We can expect good things from this student.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.520
Thank you.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:33.360
- Well then, I'll see you tomorrow.
- ﻿Yes, sir.

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.320
Thank you for the Shank.

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.280
- Bell!
- ﻿Yeah...

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.670
Noredo, you go home and get some sleep.

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:04.430
Your Holiness?

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:07.020
I will have them defend
Capital Tower's operations.

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:08.640
Do so.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:11.190
- Why, if it isn't Miss Noredo Nug.
- Yes.

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:13.560
- Good bye.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:18.490
I hear that you piloted a
pirate Mobile Suit again?

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.400
Yes, I did.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.570
The Research Division spies
on taboo breakers in foreign countries.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:26.160
Why would they take away the lady pirate?

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.910
Who is this girl?

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:30.370
She's a member of St. Flower Academy's
cheerleader squad.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.370
Miss Noredo Nug, yes?

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:35.380
Could you use your power
to get that girl back?

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:37.920
The prisoner? Why?

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.960
Bell fell in love at first sight.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:42.180
Love at first sight! Love at first sight!

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:44.970
A HAROBE? Is it yours, Noredo?

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:46.640
Its name is Nobell.

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:50.310
I'm planning to give it to Bellri as a present
when he gets into the Capital Guard.

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:52.230
I don't really...

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:54.150
I see.

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:56.190
<i>﻿Bellri managed to pilot it.</i>

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:59.070
Even Colonel Cumpa would
have to listen to you, Mom.

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:02.450
Your hand... Was it bleeding?

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:03.860
It doesn't hurt anymore.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.160
We mustn't let it get infected.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:06.530
- Hey!
- Right away.

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:22.300
They're sortieing again?

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.630
Even after Captain Cahill died, huh?

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:27.140
Won't they just get
themselves killed instead?

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:31.270
You suggest they could defeat my Montero?

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:32.140
L-Lieutenant!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.440
Lieutenant.

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:38.020
You just came back from the mainland.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:39.230
You're in no shape to sortie.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:42.690
Captain Cahill died because
he tried to save Miss Aida

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:45.570
while I was gone!

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.070
Step back, you'll fall!

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:48.660
They call them the Capital Army,

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:51.660
but they are a recently assembled
group of rank amateurs.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:54.290
I share responsibility for
failing to stop him!

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:55.620
No.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:06:00.000
The Capital Army is not anticipating
a second attack at this time.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:01.800
That is our opening.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:11.890
Don't you think you're letting being
called a genius go to your head?

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:15.480
Capital Tower has their attention
focused on space at the moment.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:17.100
That is why now is our chance!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:20.860
We haven't heard a report from
Inspector General Surugan yet!

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:23.900
That can wait until we've saved Miss Aida!

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:25.650
Thanks for the Javelin.

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:54.180
The space umbilical cord?

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.480
Until recently,

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:01.310
it was taboo for us to even go near it.

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.570
And yet...

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:08.280
Captain Cahill infiltrated that place
because of his longing for Miss Aida.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.280
Indulging in that nonsense, at his age!

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:19.710
That's one long formation.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:53.030
Oh, give me a break!

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:59.210
The lady pirate is older than you, Bellri.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:01.670
I'm concerned about that
Mobile Suit and Colonel Cumpa.

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:03.000
- ﻿You liar!
- ﻿You liar!

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.420
I'm not lying!

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:07.380
When that woman grabbed you
by the lapels, sobbing,

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:10.130
you thought what she said
was right, didn't you?

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:13.180
When you saw her off, you'd
fallen in love, hadn't you?

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:15.100
Shut up!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:39.830
What are you here for
so early in the morning?

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.080
I'﻿m Bellri Zenam.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.170
The Colonel summoned me here.

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:46.250
- ﻿Bellri? The cadet?
- ﻿Yes.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:47.710
Hey.

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:52.550
I don't know her. Who is she?

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:00.220
Raraiya Monday!

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:04.150
Come now, there's nothing to be afraid of.

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:07.190
It seems she acts like that
occasionally when left alone.

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:10.150
Though you claim to be a pirate,

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:14.410
we also have evidence you're an independent
unit recognized by the Amerian Army.

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:20.080
Your space backpack had an Amerian
domestic producer's plates and seal.

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:22.000
What?

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:25.380
Bellri Zenam says he's come
here for his questioning.

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:26.350
Bellri?

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:28.460
- ﻿Let him through.
- ﻿Yes, sir!

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:43.020
- ﻿Lower altitude.
- It'll be shaky.

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:44.480
That is no concern.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:56.240
Oh. Is this a job for the
Research Division as well?

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:58.160
It's in the same state as it was last night.

00:09:58.160 --> 00:09:59.910
Just like when the Army had it, right?

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:03.790
- ﻿Good morning!
- Good morning!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:08.080
Does time mean nothing to you when
you get an idea in your head, Bellri?

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:11.170
The name of that Mobile Suit's
instruments' manufacturer...

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.380
I didn't know it at all.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:15.720
What has she said about it?

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:18.800
Without being subjected to torture,
she's said the same.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:21.560
- ﻿Bell's in love with her.
- ﻿Noredo!

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:22.810
Was it love at first sight?

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:24.520
Love at first sight! Love!

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:25.810
That's not it!

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:28.650
What is your opinion, Colonel?

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:34.400
The Colonel is a gentleman.
You needn't worry for me.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.990
I asked her why you could operate the G-Self.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.320
Raraiya Monday!

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:42.160
Bell!

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.160
What? What's wrong?

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.370
Noredo! Nore!

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:53.460
The Capital Army is preparing to intercept?

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:56.470
What did His Holiness say?

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:57.840
It's time for his morning prayers?

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:01.100
I demand the release of the
pirate you have detained,

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:03.560
as well as the return of the Mobile Suit.

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:12.730
In the event you refuse,
I will destroy Capital Tower.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:16.940
That is all. You have been warned.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.740
Distributing Minovsky Particles.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.760
You know the rendezvous point, correct?

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:23.090
I know it.

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:24.580
Montero, separating!

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:44.960
She fell asleep after drinking this.

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:46.170
Oh.

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:48.800
The fact remains that you killed him.

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:52.180
You accuse me of being a murderer,

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:54.060
but there were many wounded
on our side as well.

00:11:54.470 --> 00:12:00.100
You have no idea how much damage was
done around Capital Tower either.

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.560
Captain Cahill was...!

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:17.330
He wanted to end Capital Tower's
monopolization of the Earth's energy.

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:21.040
The distribution of Photon Batteries
is managed by the SU-Cordists

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:24.380
in order to prevent humanity from repeating
the mistakes of the Universal Century.

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:28.380
If energy and tools are used ethically―

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:30.170
It's because people couldn't do that,

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:32.890
that humanity nearly died out
in the Universal Century!

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:34.300
Captain Cahill was―

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:37.730
A man who could have become a god, perhaps?

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:39.390
No...

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:40.520
That's taking it too far.

00:12:40.810 --> 00:12:44.110
I understand what you're saying
about the ethical use of tools.

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:47.610
That's why I wanted to ask both of you.

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:51.280
You, Aida and Bellri,
were able to pilot the G-Self.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:54.240
Raraiya Monday was as well.

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:56.120
What? What?!

00:12:56.120 --> 00:13:00.620
That girl was captured in midair
by the Capital Guard on Monday.

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:02.420
A siren?

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:04.210
- ﻿Everyone!
- ﻿An air raid?!

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:05.460
Raraiya!

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:06.670
Siren?

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.140
Sir!

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.900
Before dispersing Minovsky Particles,

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.650
he called for the return
of the prisoner, right?

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:28.110
It's at the end of the corridor, right?

00:13:28.110 --> 00:13:29.070
Bell!

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:30.400
Raraiya.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.910
Your friends have come to pick you up, huh?

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:35.450
The Captain wasn't the only one on my side.

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:37.200
Ow!

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:38.790
- ﻿What is it?
- ﻿What?

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:43.960
The Colonel said we could reach
the cockpit from the third floor.

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:46.420
- ﻿Do you believe him?
- ﻿He's testing us.

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:48.460
Because the Colonel is a member
of the Research Division.

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:01.560
What's a curtain doing in a place like this?

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.650
Aren't there any Catsiths we can use?

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:07.110
This isn't a drill! Have them sortie!

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:10.110
Do we have time to waste here?

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:12.570
This is worse than at the Capital Guard!

00:14:12.570 --> 00:14:16.620
We're busy with the air raid and prepping for
the Army's commemoration ceremony―

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:20.620
I'm telling you to get out every
Catsith and F-Rug that can move!

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.090
That was reckless.

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:37.340
It stopped.

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:40.890
The Colonel is over there.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:46.520
Trip...

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:49.570
There was a space backpack over there, right?

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:53.740
They're the Research Division, I'm sure
they requisitioned it from elsewhere.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:55.950
I wonder where.

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:56.740
Raraiya!

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:15.260
So this is Capital Tower's response, is it?

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:19.300
Even with their radar dead, they
guess at my location and advance.

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:22.310
These must be the
Recksnow I've heard about.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:24.770
A modified Recten, I presume.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:30.060
How frightening are those who
have never known war.

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:32.570
Is this part of their answer, too?

00:15:34.570 --> 00:15:35.740
I get it.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.740
If you mean to get in my way,

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.540
I have no choice but to injure you!

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:57.590
- ﻿Rayhunton Code accepted.
- ﻿You can't do that.

00:15:57.590 --> 00:15:59.010
It reacted to something, right?

00:15:59.010 --> 00:16:00.760
Huh? It's the starter.

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:07.640
Klim Nick is a young man who wants to use me.

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:09.560
Bellri Zenam, check the face.

00:16:09.810 --> 00:16:11.480
Huh? Sure!

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.610
Ah, the eyes are lit up.

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:16.360
Open the gate!

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:18.240
Don't blame me if something goes wrong!

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:23.080
Captain Dellensen, is this really okay?

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:25.580
We'll just have to make do
with the ones we have!

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:30.830
I'm taking us out!

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:32.500
Get going!

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:53.730
Hovering is impractical in the jungle!

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.490
I'll not injure you!

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:16.750
Why is it moving?!

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:18.960
If you move it, they'll misunderstand.

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:20.970
What is there to misunderstand?

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:22.880
I'm just using my own Mobile Suit

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.300
to return to my own unit.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:26.100
Oh, my.

00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:32.810
Come on... Move!

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:36.310
- ﻿Stop this!
- The Army's on the move too!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:38.110
I'm going back!

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:44.610
It didn't move at all before now!

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:46.530
There are four people aboard?

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:48.330
Oh, Director Wil.

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:50.450
What is His Holiness's will?

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:53.210
The G-Self is in the process of being stolen.

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:55.330
Do this more quietly!

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:57.090
Can you see what's in front of us?

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:00.460
You...

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:02.880
It really is Klim Nick.

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:04.890
- ﻿He took one out!
- ﻿A Catsith?

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:09.890
- ﻿What is that?
- ﻿A Montero.

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:12.600
It has a Javelin's Beam Wire function!

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:14.850
I won't let it fight at Capital Tower!

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:30.910
Hmph! They call it an Army,

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:33.410
but all you are is a bunch
of Capital Guard upstarts!

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:39.170
I am a genius!

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:45.260
Increase our altitude!

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:52.220
You fool! Using a weapon
meant for close combat!

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:53.970
Take off! We need to ascend!

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:55.270
I know that!

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:01.530
Rayhunton Code accepted.

00:19:05.030 --> 00:19:06.320
You gangly insect!

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:10.280
This is how you use a Javelin!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:15.910
Oh no!

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:18.920
Some Javelin!

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.340
That's the unit we saw last night!

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:28.010
It's probably Kerbes, right?

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.350
- ﻿Look!
- What?

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:32.560
We have fire extinguishers!

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:39.060
Is that Bellri? What's going on?

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:40.900
I'm not the pilot!

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.860
Who's piloting?!

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:44.730
Landing gear!

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:45.860
Wheels! Wheels!

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:54.620
- ﻿Step on the brakes!
- ﻿Kerbes!

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:55.870
I get it!

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:08.130
B-Bellri Zenam!

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:13.560
It's fast!

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:16.060
I've got you!

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:25.440
Is that you, Cadet Bellri?

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:26.900
Is that my lady?!

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:35.700
My lady! Miss Aida!

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:37.750
Klim Nick has come for you―

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:42.830
My lady! Why do you stop me?

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:45.800
An amateur attack like that won't hit!

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:47.380
Let's return to the Megafauna.

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:49.720
- ﻿Klim Nick!
- ﻿What? What do you mean go back?!

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:51.510
She's...

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:03.690
Oh, Director.

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:06.020
Yes, the enemy has retreated.

00:21:06.150 --> 00:21:07.690
They must have fled.

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:09.570
Given what Ameria has done,

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:13.160
we will have to cut their supply
of Photon Batteries as punishment.

00:21:13.780 --> 00:21:18.250
As you are the Operations Director,
I cannot blame you for saying that.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:22.120
I did tell you that there were four
people aboard the G-Self, right?

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:24.830
Yes, the prisoner,

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:26.960
Raraiya Monday, who was under
protective supervision,

00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:29.090
as well as Noredo Nug.

00:21:29.090 --> 00:21:31.510
What? My son?!

00:21:35.010 --> 00:21:38.680
You haven't damaged so much as one
wire on Capital Tower, have you?

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:39.930
But of course.

00:21:39.930 --> 00:21:42.640
After all, that place is going to
be the Ameria Army's base in space.

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:44.520
- ﻿Space base?
- ﻿What's he talking about?

00:21:45.020 --> 00:21:47.150
He's such an easygoing young man,

00:21:47.150 --> 00:21:49.190
even though he's the president's son.

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:51.110
He's a Mobile Suit lover.

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:05.130
The girl sitting behind
my lady can also pilot it.

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:07.420
As can the boy.

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:08.710
What is going on here?

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:10.960
Is he serious?!

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:14.340
What's with this music?

00:22:14.340 --> 00:22:16.050
It's what the designer liked, I'll bet!

00:22:21.060 --> 00:22:26.060
If today is good, tomorrow will be too.
If tomorrow is good, then the day after too.

00:24:01.930 --> 00:24:04.850
I can understand that Aida's feelings
on the matter are complicated,

00:24:04.850 --> 00:24:06.980
but so are mine.

00:24:06.980 --> 00:24:10.400
On the enemy ship, I'm told to
try and make the G-Self move.

00:24:10.400 --> 00:24:14.200
And I'm made to fight against the Capital
Army with some swell-headed lieutenant.

00:24:14.200 --> 00:24:15.660
I can't believe this.

00:24:16.660 --> 00:24:19.410
On the next episode of Reconguista in G,

00:24:19.410 --> 00:24:21.080
Wild Dance of the Catsith.

00:24:21.620 --> 00:24:24.080
Even if you don't want to watch, watch!
